+
+| Requirement | Implementation | Tasks | Checklist |
+|-------------|----------------|-------|-----------|
+| Callback authenticity | Verify provider signature over the untouched raw request body before persistence. | Callback test, verifier, callback route | [ ] Invalid signature rejected; [ ] secret not logged; [ ] no event persisted before verification |
+| Workspace isolation | Filter delivery lookup by authenticated workspace and prove denial as the request role. | Authorization test, delivery route | [ ] No bypass role; [ ] cross-workspace result not disclosed |
+| Idempotency | Database uniqueness backs callback deduplication. | Duplicate and persistence tests, unique migration, callback service | [ ] Duplicate cannot create a second row; [ ] duplicate does not replay side effects |
