+**Implements**: FR-002, FR-003
+
+**Scenario**: Submit the same valid provider event twice for one workspace. Assert the callback contract reports the second request as accepted/idempotent, exactly one `delivery_events` record exists for `(workspace_id, provider_event_id)`, and the recorded action/status belongs to that workspace. Submit the same provider event id in a different workspace only if the provider contract permits workspace-local identity; otherwise assert the unique key matches the provider’s global identity rule before implementing it.
+
+**Pattern**: Drive both requests through `POST /callbacks/reminder` and inspect persistence through the request-safe repository/test fixture. Do not mock the idempotency path.
